幼い頃ずっと夢に見ていた私にはまだ 遠いけど君がいれば
Ever since I was little, what I dreamed of is still far off for me, but as long as you are here...

305
00:35:00,208 --> 00:35:04,708
少しは強くなれる気がして
Feeling like I can become a little stronger,

306
00:35:05,108 --> 00:35:09,008
明日の色を重ね塗った
I layered on the colors of tomorrow.

307
00:35:11,208 --> 00:35:15,708
呼んだ希望辿って止めた世界を超えた
Tracing the hope I called out for, I crossed the paused world.

308
