諦めない想いいつしか心繋げた
Feelings of never giving up eventually connected our hearts.

309
00:35:22,508 --> 00:35:27,708
泣いていたって笑って明日迎えに行こう
Even if we cry, let's smile and go meet tomorrow.

310
00:35:28,308 --> 00:35:33,708
決めた誓い辛くて倒れても君のココロを守るため
Even if the vows we chose are painful and we fall, to protect your heart...

311
00:35:51,008 --> 00:36:01,208
記憶のない時の流れにきっと求めていた暖かさはあって
In the dateless flow of time, there was surely a warmth I had been seeking.

312
00:36:01,708 --> 00:36:10,208
包まれた瞬間すべての想いは君へ巡る
The moment I was enveloped, all my feelings circulate back to you.

313
00:36:11,408 --> 00:36:17,708
空に向かって走り手にしたいくつもの尊い光胸にしまって
Running toward the sky, I hold countless precious lights close to my chest.

314
00:36:23,208 --> 00:36:32,408
私の中の輝きに変え迷いを全部払って飛ぼう
Turning them into the radiance within me, brushing aside all hesitations, let's fly!

315
00:36:34,208 --> 00:36:45,208
正解の見えない入り組んだ迷路を抜け君が流した涙で心目覚めた
Escaping the unseen, tangled labyrinth, my heart awakened by the tears you shed.

316
00:36:46,208 --> 00:36:54,708
そして知った世界はこんなにもまだ綺麗で新しい可能性を生むだろう
And the world we came to know is still so beautiful, it will surely birth new possibilities.

317
00:36:55,408 --> 00:37:01,208
時のカケラの願いから
From the wishes of time's fragments...

318
00:37:13,208 --> 00:37:22,708
救い信じて割れた想い私が始まりに立って
Believing in salvation, shattered feelings—as I stand at the beginning,

319
00:37:23,708 --> 00:37:30,208
君の笑顔を取り戻すよ真実の奇跡になって
I will bring back your smile, becoming a true miracle.

320
