[Text: そっちこそ！]
[Text: Right back at you!]

328
00:38:33,413 --> 00:38:36,733
[Text: いやぁ、戦闘員がいると楽だねぇ]
[Text: Man, having combatants around makes things so easy.]

329
00:38:37,173 --> 00:38:40,093
[Text: ん？クロエ殿サボってでござるか？]
[Text: Hm? Are you slacking off, Lady Chloe?]

330
00:38:40,253 --> 00:38:42,293
[Text: サボってないよ、ほら戦ってる戦ってる]
[Text: I'm not slacking off! Look, I'm fighting, I'm fighting!]

331
00:38:42,553 --> 00:38:47,493
[Text: ……そうであるか？であれば、どんどん行くでござるよ！]
[Text: ...Is that so? If so, let's push forward, de gozaru!]

332
00:38:47,913 --> 00:38:51,313
[Text: わぁーい らいーくちーん！めっちょハッピー！]
[Text: Yay, Like-chan! So super happy!]

333
00:39:03,208 --> 00:39:10,708
