334
00:39:25,208 --> 00:39:32,708
儚く散った淡い片思い 笑い話だね 今となれば
Pale unrequited love that fleetingly scattered—just a funny story now.

335
00:39:33,208 --> 00:39:40,708
見る物全て 輝いて見えた あの日々がキレイに 笑ってるよ
Everything I saw shone brightly; those days are smiling beautifully.

336
